@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:静かですね……。|#0104Adv01_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少し前まで賑やかだったから、<br>やっぱり……寂しいです。|#0104Adv01_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:うん……。|#0104Adv01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:少女は涙を流す。<br>取り戻せない時間を慰みにしながら。|#0104Adv01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 時間経過
; ========================================

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
